  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>Meet Varbase's Design System, a game-changing open-source framework by <a href="https://www.vardot.com/en">Vardot</a> that supercharges your web development. Built on atomic design principles, it lets you craft beautiful, consistent websites with lightning speed. Whether you're juggling multiple projects or launching something new, Varbase simplifies the process with reusable components and seamless asset management, saving you time and effort.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="col pt-5 border-top border-light-subtle">
      <h2>How to Use It</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>Ready to build smarter? Varbase’s component-based approach makes creating and managing web assets a breeze. Dive into our intuitive system, explore the Figma file for design inspiration, and start turning your ideas into reality. Perfect for developers and designers alike, it’s the toolkit you didn’t know you needed!</p>
      <div class="mt-5 bg-light p-5 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center w-25">
        <img class="d-flex mx-auto d-block" src="/components/foundation/images/assets/figma-logo.svg" width="50px" alt="Figma icon logo" />
        <a class="d-flex justify-content-center"href="https://www.figma.com/design/shEqHupsCBTp2CmIiA84rv/VB---Stylesheet_2024">View Figma File</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="col pt-5 border-top border-light-subtle">
      <h2>What’s Included?</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <h3 class="mt-4">01 - Varbase Design System</h3>
      <p>Everything you need to start using the UI Toolkit to create Varbase websites.</p>

